    <info>
        <name>Teenage Engineering EP-136 K.O. Sidekick</name>
        <author>Cutlab</author>
        <description>The K.O.-sidekick as the mixer of decks 1 and 2: faders, 3-band EQ, gain, cue, FX (quick effect). With SELECT held: EQ knobs set the vocals, other and drums stems, gain sets the filter, cue plays/pauses, FX toggles sync. Mod stick: crossfader (option). Force pad: mix of effect unit 1 (SELECT: unit 2).</description>
        <manual>teenage_engineering_ep_136</manual>
    </info>
    <settings>
        <group label="Mod stick">
            <option variable="modStick" type="enum" label="Mod stick">
                <value label="Nothing (it springs back to the center)" default="true">none</value>
                <value label="Crossfader">crossfader</value>
            </option>
        </group>
    </settings>
